        "_sections_why": "`projected_costs.breakdown` is a keyed object (shared estimation-infra.schema.json; emit-plan-json.py and validate-migration-report.py read it by key), so the Observability / Security Baseline sections document the named `observability`, `security_baseline` and `security_baseline_compliance` members — not items of an array. The two Security Baseline blocks share one heading, so line anchors tell them apart (the first is `security_baseline`, the second — with `emission_reason` — is `security_baseline_compliance`). 'Cost tiers' carries the `scenario_deltas` block that estimate-infra.md requires alongside the three tiers."
