        "_allowed_anywhere_why": "schema-preferences.md defines these as row annotations usable on any row (§ 'The justification key is source' — REQUIRED on DETECTED; reason on N/A rows; context on ESSENTIAL rows; unanswered/blocks_phase/conflict per clarify-assemble.md § clarify_status; default_basis/deferred_to_generate per Q-D2). They are documented as a vocabulary, not per row, so the example block cannot list them on every row.",
        "extra_shapes": [
