              "reason",
              "context",
              "note",
              "unanswered",
              "blocks_phase",
              "conflict",
              "forced_by",
              "residency_warning",
              "detail",
              "default_basis",
              "deferred_to_generate"
            ],
            "_why": "clarify.md Step 0 sends an AI-only run through clarify-ai-only.md and skips the infra assembler. That file is a different preferences layout; infra requiredness (clarify_status) does not apply, and the AI fields stay required. route_shapes does not inherit the parent entry's allowed_anywhere (build_shape_contract is called with only this route object), so it is repeated here -- schema-preferences.md's row-annotation vocabulary, especially `source` REQUIRED on a chosen_by: extracted row, applies to this route's rows the same as the infra route's."
          }
        ]
